Description: R interface to 'JDemetra+ 3.x' (<https://github.com/jdemetra>), the time series analysis software. It provides functions for seasonal adjustment of higher-frequency data, including those with multiple or non-integer periodicities. It includes pre-adjustment via the extended airline model and several seasonal decomposition methods: extended airline model based decomposition, extended X-11, and augmented STL.
